{"id":10000024,"name":"北斗","enName":"Beidou","title":"无冕的龙王","element":"雷","region":"璃月","rarity":4,"weapon":"双手剑","birthday":"2月14日","constellation":"南天海山座","description":"武装船队「南十字」的首领，豪快的大姐头。","affiliation":"南十字船队","cv":{"chinese":"唐雅菁","japanese":"小清水亚美","english":"阿莱格拉·克拉克","korean":"郑柚美"},"avatarImg":"assets/characters/10000024-avatar.webp","splashArt":"assets/characters/10000024-art.webp","hasLocalPack":false,"voicePackageUrl":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/simon3000/genshin-voice/resolve/main/speaker-archives/Chinese/11-500/Ei.zip","voicePackageEn":"Ei","quoteCount":71,"friendLines":[{"title":"初次见面…","desc":"我是北斗，听过我的「南十字」船队吗？如果你也喜欢冒险，那就跟着我吧。我罩你。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_draw_appear","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/52/5k959cy67motfmvngudjflw9zhedrva.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·切磋","desc":"想切磋的话，我随时奉陪。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_explore_idle_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/64/nw6ukflb5lhirv5cekzo1lvvihp1sqf.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·畅饮","desc":"啊——干完活，喝口酒。真畅快。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_explore_idle_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d1/obvoj347m9m9ndykib5e31atsqle6d6.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·陆地","desc":"难得在陆地上逗留那么久，居然有点不习惯了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_explore_idle_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/16/3ylodq5brul3yvrugl7p0tohtyjzirw.mp3"},{"title":"下雨的时候…","desc":"被困荒岛的时候，雨水就是宝贵的淡水来源。嗯…虽然现在是用不上啦。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_weather_heavyRain_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a3/hxxy8f3wdrkuwdqy6syikocfsk09rju.mp3"},{"title":"打雷的时候…","desc":"喂，打雷而已。在海上不用怕，在陆地上，就更不用怕了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_weather_thunder_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1b/tmp9so2g4k4rji12kj37h91paxt5nde.mp3"},{"title":"起风的时候…","desc":"这天气，很适合出航啊。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_weather_breezy_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a3/ffwc8ue401i7pfkof9520lezpd6l1g8.mp3"},{"title":"刮大风了…","desc":"注意扬起来的风沙，别揉眼睛。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_weather_gale_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e1/tqikuewe34dv973tm0lxvvlnsfirw2n.mp3"},{"title":"早上好…","desc":"哟，早。我准备出发了，一起来？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_dialog_greetingMorning","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/91/iaz1sk99daamnjo5fa3yf2igwwmwjoy.mp3"},{"title":"中午好…","desc":"去香菱那吃午饭吧。你别说，这大锅热油炒出来的，还真和海上的烤鱼腌肉不一样。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_dialog_greetingNoon","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/53/pacw6dou9h6zly3rj1ufxx9151js7se.mp3"},{"title":"晚上好…","desc":"好，出发喝酒去喽！嗯？哈哈哈，平时没人卖酒给你是吧？那不如——","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_dialog_greetingNight","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c9/2vgjoa6be0l9w72qdhtk56rybcp36nf.mp3"},{"title":"晚安…","desc":"这时间过得可真快。去吧，一帆风顺。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_dialog_greetingNight2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/05/3qg4d5hvbh71p1favcrblrp4ctvn7zo.mp3"},{"title":"关于北斗自己…","desc":"航海准备，兄弟们，各就各位，全新的冒险要开始了！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_dialog_idle","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/48/jatr4up6exs10utl6lavn1osgrgxnxf.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·称呼","desc":"我是老大，你是我兄弟，没问题吧？哈？这些叫法太老土？行。那就按你喜欢的方式叫吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_dialog_close1","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/63/d6udvgxi3oddr78oil2ib2k8wutk7kc.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·识人","desc":"我认人很准。当你见过大海，那么普通人脸上的小水花，可就太好读懂了。哈哈，所以，我第一眼就认准了你这个家伙。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_dialog_close2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/04/slb09tjkm91jv747o75zz932s082yt6.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·选择","desc":"你是我选择的船员，是我选择的兄弟。就说这一点，都够我自豪很久。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_dialog_close3","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/bb/9sp1hc8jsdiumrw4ze78m87lzva9dg7.mp3"},{"title":"关于「神之眼」…","desc":"在那些没有「神之眼」的家伙心中，拥有「神之眼」，获得了神的认可的人，应该是旗帜吧。那么，旗帜就该有旗帜的样子。我是这样鞭策自己的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_dialog_pendant","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a4/jn31zvbcje2jil6n73eac9iv6f7619r.mp3"},{"title":"有什么想要分享…","desc":"遇到难题了吗？不知道如何向前的话，总之先迈出第一步，后面的道路就会自然而然地展开了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_dialog_share","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/38/juy728gps069b3dboepylz9jwcq42cc.mp3"},{"title":"感兴趣的见闻…","desc":"每次远航回来看见石鸢的时候，就说明差不多快到家了。海上的景色看多了难免单调，相比之下，虽说是猛禽，但那副自在翱翔的模样，总觉得亲切可爱。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_pref_gift","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/26/871qsngsab66ejdgrzssqjvoq98ee5t.mp3"},{"title":"关于凝光·璃月七星","desc":"凝光啊，从「璃月七星」的角度上来说已经做得很好了吧。只是，我要负责的对象从来就是我的船和兄弟们，不是什么「璃月七星」啊。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_teammate_ningguang_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/17/2aagvra6cxm8byrxheq4d04y4g87uf2.mp3"},{"title":"关于凝光·态度","desc":"凝光一向不怎么坦率，但她曾经很直接地表露过对我的不满。哈哈，不过啊，喜欢和讨厌都是她自己的事情，我是不可能动摇的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_teammate_ningguang_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/11/64iio8c6hc0eyhpido4kljzsu0ev1pn.mp3"},{"title":"关于香菱·好厨艺","desc":"香菱的一手好菜，可是我们一众人在远航时的念想。没力气的时候，要是想想干煸绝云椒椒那满嘴留香的滋味，都能精神几分。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_teammate_xiangling_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0d/7pb6xn1vrrifnttubv6s7xnp5q2xn28.mp3"},{"title":"关于香菱·试吃","desc":"香菱啊，她偶尔也会用一些说不上好滋味的食材，做出一些很是了不得的味道。不过嘛，没有尝试就不会有进步，我倒是挺乐意帮她试吃的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_teammate_xiangling_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d6/21hlme9thg7i3dz4b59z5nd6i6wnftd.mp3"},{"title":"关于钟离…","desc":"你说「往生堂」的那位先生吗？兄弟们有时会聊起他的传言，听上去是个很有意思的人啊。嗯，有机会去结交一下吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_teammate_zhongli_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b5/n0f2fx5wivmy1wh0soo35pzq990p5zv.mp3"},{"title":"关于魈…","desc":"有一年海灯节前夕，船队在归航时遭遇了风暴，紧赶慢赶才在入夜时分回到了璃月港。那时候海灯早就散了。我却在孤云阁的方向，看到了空中悬着一个少年模样的仙人。想必就如传闻一样，在人们看不见的地方，也有人在守护这个璃月港吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_teammate_xiao_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/72/fjnp5syt9ptvzj00sb39km8iqxcmr9i.mp3"},{"title":"关于甘雨…","desc":"我和甘雨那丫头私交不错！但你也知道，她是「璃月七星」的秘书，「七星」不待见我那可不是一天两天了。哈，我倒是无所谓，要连累了那丫头可不行。嗯，对外还是保密得好。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_teammate_ganyu_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e4/gts7zl2dn4zhqme5sslr03l1mg4n2o5.mp3"},{"title":"关于辛焱…","desc":"哈，很有意思的丫头！船上的兄弟们也有喜欢听她「摇滚」的。嗯…我本人？怎么说呢，虽然在某些方面跟辛焱有共同话题，但我的音乐品味却是另一方面的…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_teammate_xinyan_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/27/qw9bx4f4j5vhmsekoi47kt15qd5k637.mp3"},{"title":"关于瑶瑶…","desc":"瑶瑶这个小家伙啊，总是爱到船上来玩。但她那副扑闪着眼睛，见什么都新奇的样子，让谁都狠不下心来赶她走。唉，差点要打乱出航的计划。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_teammate_yaoyao_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/57/j8xf6op3dwxcyl67ia2my6u13h29gnm.mp3"},{"title":"关于枫原万叶…","desc":"听说万叶那小子在天守阁外挡了雷电将军的一刀，不简单嘛！嗯…战争结束后，他回了我们南十字船队，说是继续和我们同行一段时间。我当然是非常欢迎了，如果哪天他决定要独自踏上下一段旅程，我再打一壶好酒为他送行，哈哈。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_teammate_kazuha_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8c/njcguvivpowntdss8xurz8dv6heclwl.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解北斗·其一","desc":"想要踏上我的「死兆星」号，得先回答我一个问题。大海之中充满凶险，告诉我——你为什么想上我的船？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_friendship_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0e/0imml8fgh95eemyiqio1ceslnwq8kmb.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解北斗·其二","desc":"那些关于我的传奇故事？哈哈哈，那是兄弟们看重，才在夸我的时候添油加醋。不过，你要问我怕不怕在出海的时候遇到什么魔物，那自然是不怕的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_friendship_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e1/qplbltuud4bb2vha85fw0gstodh6ej7.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解北斗·其三","desc":"问我帮助平民的用意？哈，哪有什么用意不用意的。谁的人生还没有个低谷。我的帮助是小事，但对他们而言，迈不迈得过去那道坎，可能就是两条路啊。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_friendship_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/ef/2tajj4nvw8h1tbyle9idx719id5u2au.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解北斗·其四","desc":"我经历过痛苦的时光。小时候没摩拉买吃的，只好偷人家树上的果子，讨了几年生活。等到有了自己的船队，还是被趾高气昂的商人们排挤在外。但是，这些事当作茶余饭后的笑谈讲给你听，就足够了，我绝不会让你再经历一遍。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_friendship_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/63/er3c9pdfdu8qn9wm01ajgy5au4vpq7n.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解北斗·其五","desc":"追随我的兄弟有很多，我问过，我也记得他们每一个人上船的理由。你是很特别的。我知道你还有需要完成的事情，我不会授予你职务和头衔。但无论你的旅途去往何方，「死兆星」号上，永远都有你的位置。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_friendship_05","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/95/2asgit2ntblo89ture4tzh4ubmf8dx8.mp3"},{"title":"北斗的爱好…","desc":"爱好啊…我想想。冒险算一个，掌舵算一个，交朋友算一个，喝酒算一个，吃好吃的算一个…啧，一个手都数不过来啊。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_pref_hobby","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/63/3adim48t49h697mzcvzywlx37rxynig.mp3"},{"title":"北斗的烦恼…","desc":"搞得定的事不必烦恼，搞不定的事烦恼也没有意义。我就这样过得快快活活的。哦，要是你遇到什么想不通的事情，你可以来找我。我帮你一起解决。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_dialog_annoyed","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f5/bwbfo8e8yry56ql3lq7sikdoctbf8sl.mp3"},{"title":"喜欢的食物…","desc":"我喜欢味道重的菜！什么炝炒肉片啊，麻婆豆腐啊我就很喜欢。能填饱肚子，大家围坐一圈一起吃的时候，气氛也会变得火热火热的。哈，说得我都想去吃一顿了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_pref_foodLike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/84/dwjlg24lh4qdupbjl4p8h43w7oyr0cq.mp3"},{"title":"讨厌的食物…","desc":"我不太喜欢吃凉菜冷盘。有这慢悠悠开胃的功夫，鱼都能烤熟几条了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_pref_foodDislike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4e/jlta8mno0iq6iebg3zy8z71x6t3w1e5.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其一","desc":"好味道，我喜欢！有米饭吗，帮忙添两碗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_spice_pref_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/92/s1q25adpx5e81vc26xyqbk4e8b7f5uk.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其二","desc":"你的手艺真不错，让人心情也变得不一样了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_spice_normal_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d9/qguoxo06pk5n6byds6iq5ivbhlkn1bh.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其三","desc":"菜是好菜，这就够了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_spice_dislike_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/73/tj2y5zcc6hj7yh8yw21jtrrm2c0364l.mp3"},{"title":"生日…","desc":"来，上船。我早就跟兄弟们约好把时间腾出来了，吃的喝的也都准备好了。今天你生日，让你做一天老大。哈！嗯，想去哪？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_pref_birthday","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d7/9vy736vmucq5f9vu9l00zot6qp5b1d2.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·起","desc":"痛快！又变强了不少。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_starUp_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/ea/930vepyxa50onppree3bfmgk3on9aip.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·承","desc":"这满载而归的滋味，开瓶美酒来庆祝吧！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_starUp_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/cd/axvha3nndmcs39sanb94z1h6y5ub4jg.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·转","desc":"好样的，有你这种得力的兄弟，是我北斗的荣光！我也不能让你小瞧了啊。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_starUp_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/18/8wvcqaghx7hnw5ji92kh64vuva4iv4i.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·合","desc":"这几番操练下来，算是达到了我武艺的巅峰状态了吧。谢谢你…对了，不如再陪我过两招吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_starUp_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/ae/3pf5f6pnpfy52z5djgct3zekk0i9anh.mp3"}],"actionLines":[{"title":"元素战技·其一","desc":"闪开！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_battle_skill1_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/38/72i1lqtmw36pfqgixhqwjrq93mcsg8l.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其二","desc":"哈！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_battle_skill1_05","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/3a/rmfw2ndwiesssz4ivoi22ygx3fm8ibd.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其三","desc":"悉数奉还！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_battle_skill1_06","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/58/gxmb5r5jkiists2nsa2ip8jv4yi987l.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其四","desc":"接下吧！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_battle_skill1_07","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a0/kx2gl63n7erp974i9215wnz8an649kv.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其五","desc":"——喝啊！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_battle_skill1_08","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5b/lxb1x2rcyb69g3lbjzqcgehonia046d.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其一","desc":"这是斩灭「海山」的力量！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_battle_skill3_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5b/lqstf77zacztf7yi568x2b0szhwbhty.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其二","desc":"给我瞧好了！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_battle_skill3_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/af/a6dl2hf9zidved35l1tqpgq8fq7ermo.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其三","desc":"化作焦炭吧！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_battle_skill3_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5f/kkvjolcsnfq5bsv5yf3yabazfjey5iy.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其一","desc":"哟，真让人开心。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_chest_open_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6e/32h8i1qzraqbl8v5f6mc4nfjwhkc5z7.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其二","desc":"不错嘛，又有收获了！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_chest_open_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8a/jhky9ufic1rxnlgypouytmi826tjes4.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其三","desc":"找到了财宝，就来喝酒助兴吧！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_chest_open_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b8/op0lfufb90jkc8zrzchu8depbuq4ihz.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其一","desc":"还没完呢！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_life_less30_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d1/nibu9d36ckmvhp65a3pllgd9r7u9g92.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其二","desc":"哼，我来精神了。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_life_less30_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/98/jpw15px4btoceo1xaepe6n266z6zoyv.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其三","desc":"我绝不屈服。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_life_less30_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/66/gx6ar7e329ogvv6vz9iv5m6510w31sl.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其一","desc":"到我身后！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_life_less30_teammate_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/90/eccvb9r0vkxc8vho28bnnwfn5o7k525.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其二","desc":"退下！别逞英雄。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_life_less30_teammate_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f9/3uv29onrkc45kupb3ffvjmrf0aswbj6.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其一","desc":"糟透了。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_life_die_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/79/5wek62jqi7w1w89ijwj6b4vo86vb2rk.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其二","desc":"兄弟们…先…撤…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_life_die_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e2/ke4y0lmss1dbpqtr2p9suyiz4wpxq9m.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其三","desc":"全员…归航…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_life_die_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1e/233qhzr1iig5p8czwu5pk6a5f5t36am.mp3"},{"title":"普通受击·其一","desc":"区区小伤。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_battle_hit_L_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9b/t1usi9gjnwiy084xlnke5ye8digaqlk.mp3"},{"title":"重受击·其一","desc":"输赢还说不定呢。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_battle_hit_H_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c3/doi49t0269t5l0yh0l3gdu3y6ccqdhs.mp3"},{"title":"重受击·其二","desc":"有两下子。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_beidou/vo_beidou_battle_hit_H_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fe/mf9xjw0av2mlf0m3op8hfah8ivlc5b0.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其一","desc":"好，出发吧！","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_beidou_teamJoin_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6d/3e4g8xb7xd55mak5dyqn16ltvp9cogv.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其二","desc":"跟我来吧。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_beidou_teamJoin_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/67/a733k3jrmt5ltfwjntl6htj5nvlmaxc.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其三","desc":"我相信你。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_beidou_teamJoin_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/aa/7m8xgf63fpbd9oav9hfnho6e31xm3os.mp3"}],"cardArt":"assets/characters/10000024-card.webp","fullArt":"assets/characters/10000024-full.webp","fullArtWidth":1182,"fullArtHeight":992}